          "markdown": "**GNOME Text Editor** is the default GNOME editor for Xios: clean, fast, built on GTK4/libadwaita, and backed by GtkSourceView syntax highlighting.\n\nIt renders into the Xios display server and uses San Francisco by default when the `x11-fonts-sf` package is installed.\n\n- Syntax highlighting for common languages (GtkSourceView 5)\n- Session restore, split view, and dark mode\n- libadwaita styling"
